{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>You shall set up these stones.</b> This is what was stated above: 'והקימות לך אבנים גדולות' etc." "<b>On Mount Eival.</b> To bring comfort and set their minds at ease for those standing for the curse on Mount Eival. For this reason it writes 'ובנית שם מזבח' etc., and it writes 'וזבחת שלמיך ואכלת שם ושמחת לפני ה׳ אלוקיך' — to teach you that the Shechinah is among them."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:54:23.399293338Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}